# Portfolio Product

- This project is a **web portfolio** (browser site), not a native app
- Every feature must work on both **mobile and desktop** viewports
- Layout, typography, and spacing must be designed for both platforms from the start — do not ship desktop-only UI
- Adapt interactivity to the platform when needed:
  - desktop: hover, pointer precision, keyboard where relevant
  - mobile: touch targets, no hover-only affordances, gestures instead of hover-dependent UX
- Prefer one responsive implementation with platform-specific behavior over separate page forks
- Do not assume a feature is done until both mobile and desktop behavior are considered
